# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and in every working tree.
#
# Git for Windows checks out with `core.autocrlf=true` by default, which
# rewrites text files to CRLF on disk. `tests/node/skill-md.test.ts` compares
# the checked-in SKILL.md byte-for-byte against freshly generated (LF) output,
# so a CRLF working tree fails a test that has nothing to do with Windows.
# Pinning eol=lf here fixes that for contributors as well as CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending normalized.
*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf
